sequenceDiagram
  actor Admin
  participant FE as CreateWorkspaceForm
  participant C as WorkspaceController
  participant S as WorkspaceService
  participant U as UserRepository
  participant W as WorkspaceRepository
  participant M as WorkspaceMemberRepository
  Admin->>FE: Name, leader, members
  FE->>C: POST /workspaces (leaderUserId, members)
  C->>S: create(req, adminId)
  S->>U: findById(each seat)
  S->>S: Distinct, active, role not ADMIN, 3 roles covered
  alt team invalid
    S-->>C: 400, nothing written
  else valid team
    S->>W: save(workspace)
    S->>M: save(member) for each seat
    S-->>C: WorkspaceResponse
    C-->>FE: 201 Created
  end
